      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Circle implementation. Circleâ€™s publicly documented EVM stablecoin contract repository; distinct administrative roles for blacklisting, pausing and upgrades. Token issuer powers discussed here do not apply to all assets and chains."
      },
      {
